A thief, an informer, an evil-doer supported by a woman, / and one who prevents a gift to the fire, a cow, or a brahmin;
The vile man who sells his own wife or offspring, / and one who steals the fire vessels or any possession of ascetics;
Or one who harbors thieves, and his men, / an official placed over brahmins, and an official placed over religious law;

